      "description": "<p><strong>Trigger</strong> The living whirlwind takes damage from a hostile action;</p>\n<hr />\n<p><strong>Effect</strong> The living whirlwind disperses. Until the end of the current turn, it can't be attacked or targeted, doesn't take up space, and its high winds aura is suppressed.</p>\n<p>At the end of the turn, the living whirlwind reforms in any unoccupied space within 25 feet of where it dispersed, and its high winds are restored.</p>",
